  2.11.0 bug in new plumbing. (1) Framing the trigger as "the grade CROSSES INTO the approval
  point" converts a state predicate into an edge predicate — work graded 7 at the outset never
  crosses, so it would have been owed no approval at all. Fixed by scoping the bullet to "an
  approval you already hold", never to "when approval is required", and leaving the anchor
  sentence untouched. (2) Defining "amended" over plan: slots is vacuous on the plan-mode path
  where no line exists; a grade-7 plan-mode task growing beyond its approved plan would have
  proceeded unapproved. Fixed by defining amendment twice, once per path.
